{"3059770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Leveleers", "steam_appid": 3059770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> <i>This game is in full development. The screenshots and trailer do not represent the final quality of the game at the moment!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELEERS is a co-op adventure game with escape room like puzzles, platformer elements and an isometric perspective that allows for unique puzzles that are not possible with a first person perspective. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear dense hand-crafted ‘escape room’-like puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ‘no rush’ attitude.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous atmospheric isometric world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platforming mechanics (jumping, crouching, running) add agility to the mix.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, two androids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the characters’ heartbreaking story and help them find peace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or co-op with your friends (locally or online).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside-the-box thinking required ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be played together with friends like escape rooms. To make playing together more fun, each player can control a character to make the experience more interactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can technically play the game alone. There is no simultaneous input from more than one player required to be able to complete the puzzles. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> <i>This game is in full development. The screenshots and trailer do not represent the final quality of the game at the moment!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELEERS is a co-op adventure game with escape room like puzzles, platformer elements and an isometric perspective that allows for unique puzzles that are not possible with a first person perspective. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear dense hand-crafted ‘escape room’-like puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ‘no rush’ attitude.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous atmospheric isometric world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platforming mechanics (jumping, crouching, running) add agility to the mix.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, two androids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the characters’ heartbreaking story and help them find peace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or co-op with your friends (locally or online).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside-the-box thinking required ;-)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be played together with friends like escape rooms. To make playing together more fun, each player can control a character to make the experience more interactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can technically play the game alone. There is no simultaneous input from more than one player required to be able to complete the puzzles. </p>", "short_description": "Help two droids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities, find their way out of the game itself. Think outside the box in this co-op adventure game with dense hand-crafted escape room like puzzles. Immerse yourself in the atmospheric isometric world with your friends or on your own.", "sup